  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: <br>&bull; Product description: Hypoallergenic 100% Organic Cotton Clothing<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):100% Organic Cotton<br>&bull; Payment terms:Paypal&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:<br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(112, 113, 115); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Cottonique is a perfect solution to making life with allergies and other skin sensitivities more&nbsp; comfortable for men, women, and children. The products include latex/spandex-free and&nbsp; chemical-free 100% cotton bras, briefs, shorts, t-shirts, and nightwear, both in elasticized styles.&nbsp; Cottonique eliminates the use of bleaching compounds, color dyes, and textile resins that can&nbsp; pose a threat to sensitive skin. The cotton used is 100% organically-grown and the fabric is&nbsp; highly absorbent and breathable. </span>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</div>",
